# terraform.tfvars.example — int/connectivity
#
# uksouth deploy values:
#   ../../region/uksouth/int.connectivity.tfvars
#
# AzDo loads that file via -var-file. Local:
#   terraform plan -var-file=../../region/uksouth/int.connectivity.tfvars -var=location=uksouth
#
# This example is intentionally not a full var set (avoids duplicating region files).
